WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.126
Josh Norman!

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:03.294
Do people in the NFL think you’re weird?

00:00:03.294 --> 00:00:04.045
- [Clanging]

00:00:04.045 --> 00:00:05.338
- [Sniffing] Smell it!

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.256
- What is going on?!

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:07.173
- [Laughing]

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:08.550
Yeah.

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:13.013
- Lefkoe here in Virginia to get a
tour of Josh Norman’s insane house.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:17.851
5,400 square feet of toys, bells and
whistles, and with all that, he better have

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:21.479
good homeowners insurance, and I
really hope it’s with State Farm.

00:00:21.479 --> 00:00:26.860
State Farm is sponsoring this episode, but they
also have phenomenal homeowners insurance.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.194
I wouldn’t steer you wrong.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:29.571
Let’s go ditch the playbook.

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:32.449
♪♪♪

00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:37.120
♪♪♪

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:41.166
Just in case you didn’t know whose house
it was—

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:43.501
yeah, he lets you know right in the driveway.

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:45.920
JNo24, Josh Norman.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.672
One of the best cornerbacks in the league.

00:00:47.672 --> 00:00:51.176
I gotta see what makes him the
most interesting man in the NFL.

00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:56.723
Well, look who it is!

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.391
How you feelin’, my man?
- My man.
What’s up, Lef?

00:00:58.391 --> 00:00:59.601
- Good to see you.
- You all right?

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.936
- You look good.
- Good to see you.
- Your house looks amazing.

00:01:01.936 --> 00:01:03.271
- Come on, man. Come on in.

00:01:05.523 --> 00:01:06.775
- I like the art.

00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:08.818
I like the tone—like, the colors.

00:01:08.818 --> 00:01:11.071
So this is the volleyball
court that I’ve heard about.

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:14.449
This is movie theater-level amounts of candy!

00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:15.575
[Loud music] Wow.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.871
I can feel it in my bones right now.
- [Laughing]

00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:23.792
- Everybody has a pair of shoes that
kind of represents them the most.

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:26.711
On the wall, which ones—which
one is Josh Norman?

00:01:26.711 --> 00:01:28.088
- Which one is me—
- Yeah.

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:30.215
- That represents me the
most out of these shoes.

00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:31.800
This is it right here.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:34.636
That’s why it’s out here sittin’ by itself.
- I was gonna say, it’s by itself.

00:01:34.636 --> 00:01:37.097
- That’s why it’s by itself!
With everything else, it is by itself.

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:40.892
- No matter what city Josh lives in, no
matter where he goes in the world, he is

00:01:40.892 --> 00:01:45.980
still a cowboy boot-wearin’,
horse-rearin’ country man.

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:48.733
- Hey, it’s through your blood and blood.
- All through your blood.

00:01:50.026 --> 00:01:54.030
- This is my very own personal barbershop.

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:55.406
- Oh, you got your logo on it.

00:01:55.406 --> 00:01:56.366
- [Laughing]

00:01:56.366 --> 00:01:58.326
- This guy’s unbelievable.

00:01:58.326 --> 00:02:00.912
So do you have, like, your own
private masseuse that comes over?

00:02:00.912 --> 00:02:03.123
- Yes. I have my own private masseuse
that comes over.

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:04.666
I have three of ‘em actually.

00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:05.792
- Three masseuses.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:10.213
So you get your hair cut in the basement, you
get your massages upstairs—you really do not

00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:11.297
need to leave this house.

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:12.340
- It’s a one-stop shop.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:15.260
- There’s not a lot of NFL players
that do Dancing with the Stars.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:19.848
There’s not a lot of NFL players that
have giraffes in their living room.

00:02:19.848 --> 00:02:21.015
- Yeah, man.

00:02:21.015 --> 00:02:23.643
- Do—I mean, do people in
the NFL think you’re weird?

00:02:24.853 --> 00:02:25.687
- Yeah.

00:02:25.687 --> 00:02:26.771
- Really?

00:02:26.771 --> 00:02:28.356
- [Laughing]

00:02:28.356 --> 00:02:31.192
- They thinkin’, like, “Something’s wrong
with this guy.” Like, “Yeah, I know he’s

00:02:31.192 --> 00:02:33.820
interesting, but, you know,
he’s just a little bit off.”

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:34.529
- Little bit off.

00:02:35.238 --> 00:02:37.282
- I gotta show you the
best room in the house.

00:02:37.282 --> 00:02:38.158
- Really?

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.993
- Out of all the rooms, this
is the best one in the house.

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:41.995
- OK. Oh my God.

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:45.039
This is the perfect spot for your kid.

00:02:45.039 --> 00:02:47.167
- This is the lair of the princess.

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:53.298
- I love the fact that there is a pony at
a table with what looks to be one of the most

00:02:53.298 --> 00:02:55.175
incredible makeup jobs I’ve ever seen.

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:58.219
- You know what?
I, I’ve never seen anything better.

00:02:58.219 --> 00:02:59.554
Never.
- [Laughing]

00:03:02.056 --> 00:03:03.558
- What is that?!

00:03:03.558 --> 00:03:04.893
- Come on.

00:03:06.394 --> 00:03:07.520
- What is going on?!

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.272
- [Laughing]

00:03:09.272 --> 00:03:11.566
- Conan the Barbarian!
- I’m a, I’m a little—

00:03:11.566 --> 00:03:13.902
- This is like 50, 60 pounds.

00:03:13.902 --> 00:03:15.195
- Yes.

00:03:15.195 --> 00:03:16.863
- Bro, you’re such a nerd. I love it.

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:18.990
- Dude, I’m ridiculous.
- You’re a big-time nerd.

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:20.116
- [Laughing] Yes!

00:03:20.116 --> 00:03:23.077
- Please tell me that you
wear that around the house.

00:03:23.077 --> 00:03:24.454
This should be the new helmet in the NFL.

00:03:24.454 --> 00:03:25.914
- [Clanging]

00:03:25.914 --> 00:03:29.834
- Can you imagine if somebody tried to break
into Josh Norman’s house and he came upstairs

00:03:29.834 --> 00:03:32.545
with a sword and a Captain America?

00:03:32.545 --> 00:03:33.463
- It’s serious!

00:03:33.463 --> 00:03:35.381
- I know you’re obsessed with Batman.

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:37.675
Like, with every morsel of your body.

00:03:37.675 --> 00:03:41.429
So when I came in and I saw this, man, like—

00:03:41.429 --> 00:03:44.015
- Yeah, but...

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:47.644
the artist who did it sucked.

00:03:47.644 --> 00:03:48.561
- What do you mean?

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:49.938
- Does that look like me?!

00:03:49.938 --> 00:03:51.147
- Oh, it was supposed to look like you?

00:03:51.147 --> 00:03:51.898
- Yeah, supposed to.

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:54.567
- Oh, this was supposed to be
you in a Bat—oh, that’s not good.

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:55.318
- Exactly, right?!

00:03:55.318 --> 00:03:56.819
- No, I was like—I mean—

00:03:56.819 --> 00:03:58.112
- [Laughing] It’s like, “What is that?!”

00:03:58.112 --> 00:03:59.280
- I wanna see your bar too.

00:03:59.322 --> 00:03:59.739
- Oh, for sure.

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:00.698
Lemme show you this bar.

00:04:02.617 --> 00:04:04.994
Take a wild guess what you think this is.

00:04:06.454 --> 00:04:07.622
- Is that wood chips?

00:04:07.622 --> 00:04:10.041
- This is mamajuana.

00:04:10.041 --> 00:04:11.626
- I’mma wanna know what that is.

00:04:11.626 --> 00:04:12.669
- Whooop.

00:04:12.669 --> 00:04:14.879
- Oh, really?
- [Laughing]

00:04:16.631 --> 00:04:19.467
- This is why he’s the most
interesting man in the NFL.

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:26.975
Every house, there’s always that thing
where they go, “And this is where the magic

00:04:26.975 --> 00:04:28.768
happens.” But I’m not gonna do it.

00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:30.436
- It’s fine, you can sit on the edge.

00:04:30.436 --> 00:04:31.688
- All right.

00:04:31.688 --> 00:04:32.814
- How does it feel?

00:04:32.814 --> 00:04:36.109
- It feels like a very
soft, plush bed, you know?

00:04:36.109 --> 00:04:37.652
A little chinchilla—it’s nice.

00:04:37.652 --> 00:04:39.279
- But then when you turn
around and you turn it up...

00:04:41.698 --> 00:04:42.532
- The bed is shaking.

00:04:42.532 --> 00:04:44.075
- [Laughing]

00:04:44.075 --> 00:04:46.452
- Josh, what is, what is—is this
like a massage type of thing?

00:04:46.452 --> 00:04:48.621
- Yes.
- I don’t feel comfortable.

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:49.998
- [Laughing]

00:04:49.998 --> 00:04:52.333
- Wow.

00:04:52.333 --> 00:04:53.918
This is where the magic happens.

00:04:53.918 --> 00:04:55.503
- [Laughing]

00:04:57.505 --> 00:04:59.048
- Oooh.

00:04:59.048 --> 00:05:04.679
- This is the Z28 ‘72 split
bumper Chevrolet Camaro.

00:05:04.679 --> 00:05:06.639
- [Sighing]

00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:09.600
- [Sniffing] Smell it!

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.769
- [Inhaling] She smells amazing.

00:05:11.769 --> 00:05:13.604
- There’s nothin’ like old-school.

00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:24.198
[Engine revving]

00:05:24.198 --> 00:05:28.328
- This is Batman’s Batmobile right here.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:34.292
[Engine revving]

00:05:34.292 --> 00:05:38.838
Hope you guys enjoyed meeting the
most interesting man in the NFL.

00:05:38.838 --> 00:05:41.424
But while we’re ditchin’ the
playbook, I gotta ditch you guys, man.

00:05:41.424 --> 00:05:43.551
So I’mma holler atcha.

00:05:43.551 --> 00:05:45.219
Let’s do it.
- You ready?

00:05:45.219 --> 00:05:46.637
All right, man.

00:05:47.513 --> 00:05:50.350
It is unreal.

